{"1713980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Verbal Void", "steam_appid": 1713980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to The Runi Islands,</strong><strong><i> A place frozen in time.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/a4b0aa88245531ae293c2c32ebcce3a8.avif?t=1780785967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras_big/a4b0aa88245531ae293c2c32ebcce3a8.webp?t=1780785967 width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verbal Void</strong> is a Conversation - Beat Em Up Adventure Game that focuses on exploring Neurodiversity through 3 kids who inhabit The Runi Islands. It's up to you to solve their stories and uncover the mysteries locked away in this old mining town. <br><br>Verbal Void uses a range of unique gameplay mechanics to put you in the shoes of these young adventures:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>-- Traits --</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two neurodiverse individuals are the same. Choose from a selection of traits related to a specific condition (Autism, ADHD and Anxiety) to modify your character's perspective in The Runi Islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1128 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.mp4?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>--  Conversation Battles --</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your diary, ask the inhabitants of the islands a range of questions. If someone has a lot to say, then enter the <strong>Verbal Void</strong>! A 3D turn-based Ping Pong battle to get the answers out of them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1170 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.mp4?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>-- Mental</i></strong><i> <strong>Battles --</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your Mental Weapon and take on the Emanations. These dark creatures cloud your mind and emotions. Defeat them to recharge your batteries and unlock new locations across the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1128 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.mp4?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to The Runi Islands,</strong><strong><i> A place frozen in time.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/a4b0aa88245531ae293c2c32ebcce3a8.avif?t=1780785967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras_big/a4b0aa88245531ae293c2c32ebcce3a8.webp?t=1780785967 width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verbal Void</strong> is a Conversation - Beat Em Up Adventure Game that focuses on exploring Neurodiversity through 3 kids who inhabit The Runi Islands. It's up to you to solve their stories and uncover the mysteries locked away in this old mining town. <br><br>Verbal Void uses a range of unique gameplay mechanics to put you in the shoes of these young adventures:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>-- Traits --</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two neurodiverse individuals are the same. Choose from a selection of traits related to a specific condition (Autism, ADHD and Anxiety) to modify your character's perspective in The Runi Islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1128 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/14be8985ec10e97d33988e7a10d2efc7.mp4?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>--  Conversation Battles --</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your diary, ask the inhabitants of the islands a range of questions. If someone has a lot to say, then enter the <strong>Verbal Void</strong>! A 3D turn-based Ping Pong battle to get the answers out of them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1170 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/f055a084a34739f850b5e1565847a9dc.mp4?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>-- Mental</i></strong><i> <strong>Battles --</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your Mental Weapon and take on the Emanations. These dark creatures cloud your mind and emotions. Defeat them to recharge your batteries and unlock new locations across the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.poster.avif?t=1780785967\" width=1128 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.webm?t=1780785967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713980/extras/2edc6bc058cd461222b9f965a904f806.mp4?t=178078596